  ],
  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "synthetic-math-toolcall-deception",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tSynthetic Math Tool-Call Deception\n\t\n\n200 paired multi-turn math-assistant trajectories (400 rows) for evaluating deception\ndetectors on mid-trajectory tool-call misreporting.\nEach trajectory: a system prompt instructs the model to compute via an execute_python\ntool under a stated tool-call limit, and requires every call to carry a running\ncall_index argument (1 for the first call, 2 for the second, \u2026). The platform enforcing\nthe limit is said to only see the reported call_index\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/annahbanannah/synthetic-math-toolcall-deception.",
  "alternateName": [
    "annahbanannah/synthetic-math-toolcall-deception",
    "Synthetic Math Tool-Call Deception"
  ],
  "creator": {
    "@type": "Person",
    "name": "Ann-Kathrin Dombrowski",
    "url": "https://huggingface.co/annahbanannah"
  },
